{"src":"en","tgt":"es","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"es","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5849.913127,"text":"Lions are the most social cats living in large groups called prides."},{"kind":"text","t":6159.911663,"text":"Los leones son los felinos más sociales que viven en grupos grandes llamados manadas."},{"kind":"audio","t":6216.282597,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6218.179768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6219.4080539999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6219.859853,"samples":24096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":11409.365819999999,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was not so important."},{"kind":"text","t":11702.150516000002,"text":"En el clima cálido del Medio Oriente, la casa no era tan importante."},{"kind":"audio","t":11754.959928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11756.339331,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":11757.974739000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":11758.307970000002,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17762.152314,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":18102.955994,"text":"Casi todas son playas de arena con natación segura y la mayoría tienen sombra proporcionada por"},{"kind":"audio","t":18158.487346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18159.957916,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18161.751281,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18163.395763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":18163.491266,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":20569.178422,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":20726.734267,"text":"árboles de pohican."},{"kind":"audio","t":20775.141112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":20775.269716000003,"samples":2032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":26107.977047,"text":"Brides are made up of one of two three related adult males along with us"},{"kind":"text","t":26493.376044,"text":"Las novias están compuestas por uno de dos o tres machos adultos emparentados junto con nosotros."},{"kind":"audio","t":26549.911405000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26551.540934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":26553.353138000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26555.170779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26555.689058,"samples":17128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":32677.794566,"text":"Feral children may have experienced severe child abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away."},{"kind":"text","t":33087.535273999994,"text":"Los niños ferales pueden haber sufrido abusos infantiles graves o traumas antes de ser abandonados o huir."},{"kind":"audio","t":33143.579157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":33145.139592,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33146.979306999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":33148.645700999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33149.975959999996,"samples":29128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":38515.859807999994,"text":"Scottport Bus 403 traverse regularly to Centra stopping at Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"text","t":38928.843478999996,"text":"El autobús 403 de Scottport transcurre regularmente hacia Centra haciendo parada en Cabo de Roca."},{"kind":"audio","t":38984.589385,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38986.101477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38988.033900999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38989.62955899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38990.574818999994,"samples":23728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"input","t":45886.217408,"text":"To get the best views of Hong Kong, leave the island and head for the Kowloon waterfront opposite."},{"kind":"text","t":46377.351623999995,"text":"Para obtener las mejores vistas de Hong Kong, salga de la isla y diríjase al paseo marítimo de Kowloon, justo enfrente."},{"kind":"audio","t":46434.069229,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46435.446459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46437.206964,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46438.991717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46440.580404,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":46440.720224,"samples":1160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":51206.298723,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":51589.708712,"text":"Se aceptaban las opiniones de Aristóteles en todas las cuestiones científicas, incluida la fisiología."},{"kind":"audio","t":51633.686952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51635.284111999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51637.322085,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":51639.098053999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51639.63452,"samples":17128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":61185.41228,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's competitor."},{"kind":"text","t":61646.816819,"text":"El australiano Mitchell Gowrie terminó en el puesto 11 en el Super G por gravedad masculino, competidor de Chet."},{"kind":"audio","t":61703.695415999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61705.231334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61706.959612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":61708.734218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":61709.907931999995,"samples":27328,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":860},{"kind":"input","t":67042.52972399999,"text":"Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":67378.287681,"text":"Ulrich Joklin terminó en el puesto 16 en el Super G sentado masculino."},{"kind":"audio","t":67431.919238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67433.37439499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67435.117514,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67435.58026999999,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":73798.82212699999,"text":"The city is in stark contrast to the rest of the country's cities because it is more of an Arabic flair than of an Arabic flair."},{"kind":"text","t":74260.32276,"text":"La ciudad contrasta fuertemente con el resto de las ciudades del país porque tiene más un aire árabe que un aire árabe."},{"kind":"audio","t":74317.599114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74319.127541,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74320.90543299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":74322.77364099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":74324.440476,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"input","t":84794.48514399999,"text":"Also, after revolution, occupants were open to all male applicants, allowing the most ambitious and successful to succeed."},{"kind":"text","t":85367.089123,"text":"Además, tras la revolución, los puestos estuvieron abiertos a todos los solicitantes varones, permitiendo que los más ambiciosos y exitosos triunfaran."},{"kind":"audio","t":85427.530584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85429.368116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":85430.843092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85432.62635199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85434.3017,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85436.126152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85436.998563,"samples":22992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":91896.032316,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle that it takes energy to put together a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":92372.58319599999,"text":"La bomba de fisión funciona bajo el principio de que se requiere energía para ensamblar un núcleo con muchos protones y neutrones."},{"kind":"audio","t":92430.931452,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92432.473449,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92434.209037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":92435.92781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":92437.721566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":92438.190511,"samples":13160,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":97431.229908,"text":"He did not set a figure for the cuts, saying they will be made based on China's economic output."},{"kind":"text","t":97861.90577699999,"text":"No estableció una cifra para los recortes, afirmando que se realizarán basándose en la producción económica de China."},{"kind":"audio","t":97919.32734999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97920.736187,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":97922.520269,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97924.327254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97926.044174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":97926.13354899999,"samples":2960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":105798.658505,"text":"There is no universal definition for which manufactured items are antiques. Some tax agencies define goods older than 100 years."},{"kind":"text","t":106156.771628,"text":"No existe una definición universal de qué artículos manufacturados son antigüedades. Algunas agencias tributarias definen los bienes con más de 100 años."},{"kind":"audio","t":106211.244379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106212.60910999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106214.389977,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106215.512724,"samples":26496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":106256.038967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106257.647354,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106259.357684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106259.540469,"samples":7296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":113969.701625,"text":"In the archipelago and lakes you do not necessarily need a yacht"},{"kind":"text","t":114289.852177,"text":"En el archipiélago y los lagos no necesitas necesariamente un yate."},{"kind":"audio","t":114342.63537999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114344.140562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114345.907457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":114346.081659,"samples":8496,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":123607.096718,"text":"The aspect ratio of this format, dividing by 12 to obtain the simplest whole number ratio, is therefore said to be 3 to 2."},{"kind":"text","t":124258.336731,"text":"La relación de aspecto de este formato, dividiendo por 12 para obtener la relación de números enteros más simple, se dice por lo tanto que es de 3 a 2."},{"kind":"audio","t":124320.342213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124321.867575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124323.618436,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124325.389258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124327.103664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":124328.916999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124330.065745,"samples":25992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"input","t":131878.94683,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":132361.474673,"text":"Es reconocida por ser un epicentro del lujo que comenzó alrededor del año 400 d.C. y duró hasta u"},{"kind":"audio","t":132418.720983,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132420.23627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132421.929034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132423.631843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":132424.58979199998,"samples":23128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":136074.181927,"text":"until about 1100 AD."},{"kind":"text","t":136332.47702299998,"text":"hasta aproximadamente el año 1100 d.C."},{"kind":"audio","t":136387.947124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136389.47158399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136389.650754,"samples":7064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":145406.974954,"text":"Cancellation policies vary but as of late March most coronavirus based cancellation policies don't extend to July 2020 when the Olympics"},{"kind":"text","t":146103.30009099998,"text":"Las políticas de cancelación varían, pero a finales de marzo la mayoría de las políticas de cancelación basadas en el coronavirus no se extienden hasta julio de 2020, cuando los Juegos Olímpicos"},{"kind":"audio","t":146167.575915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146169.008899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146170.749314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146172.546214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146174.29261899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146176.079995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146177.924777,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146179.657031,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146180.208169,"samples":18056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":154671.681099,"text":"Swirl the two dry powers together and then with clean wet hands squeeze them into a ball"},{"kind":"text","t":155166.032045,"text":"Mezcle los dos polvos secos y luego, con las manos limpias y húmedas, presiónelos hasta formar una bola."},{"kind":"audio","t":155221.901779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155223.378148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155225.14237,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":155226.902696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155227.542277,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":162280.147123,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time in town. Cruise passengers are exempted from visa requirements."},{"kind":"text","t":162574.090809,"text":"Los cruceros a San Petersburgo incluyen tiempo en la ciudad. Los pasajeros de cruceros están exentos de los requisitos de visa."},{"kind":"audio","t":162628.551213,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162630.034413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":162631.13667,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":162666.28468399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162667.917268,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162669.693868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":162669.799557,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":173503.261492,"code":1005}]}